  "description": "“We will eventually end up together.”\nMercenary Kang Iheon, while on an undercover mission, unexpectedly encounters his former direct superior, Sergeant Lee Junho, who had lost contact with him five years ago. From their time together, both had felt a strong pull toward each other, yet the harsh reality kept them apart. However, their fateful reunion grants them a second chance…\nWhat matters most is that, despite all the changes in their lives, their desire for each other remains unchanged.\nThis time, will Iheon and Junho be able to face their feelings head-on?\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/nearmiss), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/nearmiss)",
